] (2 of 3) [CRLMB-1490/2025] Learned counsel submitted that the investigating after conducting thorough investigation in connection with the FIR lodged by the prosecutrix submitted challan paper before the competent criminal Court against the present petitioner only.
It was contended that the statements of the prosecutrix have already been recorded before the competent criminal Court on 07.01.2025 as PW-01.
Further, while she was in the custody of present petitioner, she did not make any effort to run away.
